<title>UK: UK Nelson oilfield below capacity again in Feb.</title>
<headline>UK Nelson oilfield below capacity again in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enterprise Oil Plc's British Nelson field performed below capacity again in February, the company said.</p>
<p>Nelson pumped 144,751 barrels per day (bpd) of crude and natural gas liquids in February from 137,000 bpd in January.</p>
<p>Nelson peaked at 186,000 bpd in January of last year but technical difficulties kept it an average 165,000 bpd for the year.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
